<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-indent: 0.5in"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">1.1
The Company engages the Director as an independent contractor to provide the services described in Section A of Schedule A attached hereto
(the &ldquo;<U>Services</U>&rdquo;), and the Director agrees to perform such Services.</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-indent: 0.5in"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-indent: 0.5in"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">1.2
The Company will pay to the Director the compensation indicated in Schedule A (the &ldquo;<U>Compensation</U>&rdquo;), as full payment
for providing the Services and for necessary expenses incurred in connection therewith, in the manner and at the times set out in Schedule
A attached hereto, and the Director will accept such compensation as full payment as aforesaid.</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-indent: 0.5in"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;</FONT></P>

