<P STYLE="text-align: justify; font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-indent: 0.5in"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">12.12
<U>Statute</U>. Any reference to a statute in this Agreement, regardless of whether that statute has been defined or cited, includes
all regulations made under it, any amendments made to it and in force, and any statute passed in replacement of or in substitution for
it.</FONT></P>

